{
 "dur": 70.064,
 "segments": [
  {
   "key": "L1",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Elon Musk says there will be ten billion of these.",
   "s": 0.5,
   "e": 3.021,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L2",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "More robots than people on Earth.",
   "s": 4.121,
   "e": 5.885,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L3",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "He said it in Riyadh, in twenty twenty-four: at least ten billion humanoid robots, by twenty forty.",
   "s": 6.435,
   "e": 11.975,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L4",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "This year, he went further.",
   "s": 12.425,
   "e": 13.977,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "MB",
   "type": "musk",
   "text": "musk 0.00 11.10",
   "s": 14.277,
   "e": 25.377,
   "src": [
    0.0,
    11.1
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "L5",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "So what would they actually do?",
   "s": 25.977,
   "e": 27.608,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L6a",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Factories first.",
   "s": 28.608,
   "e": 30.055,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L6b",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Then warehouses.",
   "s": 30.955,
   "e": 31.927,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L6c",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Your groceries.",
   "s": 32.827,
   "e": 33.645,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L6d",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Your lawn.",
   "s": 34.545,
   "e": 35.226,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L7",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "And, in his own words, they'll babysit your kids.",
   "s": 36.126,
   "e": 38.64,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L8",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "One robot that could replace you? From twenty thousand dollars.",
   "s": 39.24,
   "e": 42.861,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L9",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Now, the math. Tesla is aiming for a million robots a year. At that pace, ten billion would take ten thousand years.",
   "s": 44.261,
   "e": 50.547,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L10",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "So either the plan is wrong... or something changes.",
   "s": 51.247,
   "e": 54.138,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "MC",
   "type": "musk",
   "text": "musk 35.46 39.40",
   "s": 54.388,
   "e": 58.328,
   "src": [
    35.46,
    39.4
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "L11",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "And the first robots for outside customers? Reportedly, late twenty twenty-seven.",
   "s": 58.828,
   "e": 63.636,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L12",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Coincidence?",
   "s": 64.536,
   "e": 65.285,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L13",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Every prediction leads to twenty twenty-seven.",
   "s": 65.735,
   "e": 68.264,
   "src": null
  }
 ]
}